Package: com.guacforlife.debautopatcher
Name: SileoDebAutoPatcher
Version: 0.1.1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Automates the Sileo -> RootHide Patcher -> Sileo flow for tweaks that need roothide conversion. Accepts Sileo's "Not Updated" prompt, waits a cancellable 1.5s so the conversion options can still be changed, activates Convert .deb, hands the result back to Sileo, and taps Get — stopping at the confirm screen.
Maintainer: guacforlife
Author: guacforlife
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader
